DATA LICENSE

The code in this repository is released under the MIT License above.

The TREK dataset (the synthetic knowledge base under api/data/, and the task
files trek_queries.csv and trek_gold.jsonl) is released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The city/airport scaffold is derived from the public-domain OurAirports
dataset (https://ourairports.com/data/); only city and airport identifiers
are reused. All bookable content (prices, schedules, amenities, ratings) is
synthetic and does not describe any real service.
